      "en": "$tsceepi_rate"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the general statutory pension (old-age) social insurance contribution rate (latest 8.72%) within Lithuania's SODRA system, one of the most widely used constants in the spine. It underlies the aggregate self-employed rate ($tscse_TotRate in ConstDef_lt), the contribution ceiling formula in tscct_lt, the employee contribution cap (UpLim) in tscee_lt ('Pension'), employer pension contributions in tscer_lt/BenCalc, and self-employed/administrative pension insurance calculations in tscse_lt and tscse_admin_lt. It represents the employee-borne share of the state pension insurance contribution used across employed, employer, and self-employed contribution modules."
    },
